/**
@page library Library

@brief The engineering reference for @c libbotanik - subsystems, concepts,
       architecture deep-dives, build targets, and tests.

`libbotanik` is split into independent subsystems under `src/libbotanik/`, wired
together by the `BotanikFirmware<In, Out>` base and run from a single non-blocking
loop. This page is the map; the **Namespaces** and **Classes** tabs hold the full
API surface.

@section library_metrics At a glance

These two charts are regenerated on every docs build (by `scripts/code_charts.py`),
broken down by code area (the folder under `src/`). The first sizes each area; the
second shows where recent work has gone.

